  "historyNote": "#6061, INTERIM, eff 7-13-95, EXPIRES: 1-9-96; ss by #6162, eff 1-4-96, EXPIRED: 1-4-04 New. #8028, INTERIM, eff 1-17-04, EXPIRED: 7-15-04 New. #8286-A, eff 2-16-05",
